1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,120
Jadi rasa malas tu, syaitan antara

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,080
pembantulah.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,080
Lepas tu dia ajar kita berdoa:

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,680
Allahumma inni a'uzu bika minal

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,460
hammi wal hazan, wa a'uzu bika

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,800
minal 'ajzi wal kasal.

7
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,800
Ya Allah, aku mohon lindung pada-Mu

8
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,955
daripada hammi, daripada rasa susah

9
00:00:21,955 --> 00:00:25,200
hati, wal hazan, rasa duka cita.

10
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,819
Kacau otak kita, susah hati.

11
00:00:27,819 --> 00:00:30,250
Hazan, sedih kerana kematian itu,

12
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:31,640
kematian ini, hilang itu, hilang

13
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:31,940
ini, sedih.

14
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,470
Hammi, susah hati.

15
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,460
Lagu itu benda yang kita memikirkan,

16
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,680
ham dia panggil, susah hati kita.

17
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:40,190
Tapi bila sedih ni, kehilangan

18
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:42,640
benda, marilah sedih.

19
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:45,360
Oleh kerana benda ni, benda yang

20
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,440
kita tak boleh nak kawal,

21
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,910
satu benda yang tak boleh kita

22
00:00:51,910 --> 00:00:54,960
kawal, maka tempat lindungnya Allah sahaja.

23
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:58,320
Rasa sedih tak boleh nak kawal.

24
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:02,320
Kereta orang langgar, dum, sedih tak?

25
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,320
Sedih, tapi tak nak keluar.

26
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:09,120
Kalau dibayar oleh takaful pun, masa

27
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,400
pula tak boleh.

28
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,400
Nak bayar masa?

29
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,860
Kereta hilang tiga minggu ke, duduk

30
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:17,120
kat bengkel, nak klaim takaful lagi pula.

31
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:19,120
Hal ini tak boleh kawal.

32
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:22,750
Berlaku benda-benda yang mengganggu,

33
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:24,160
susah hati, tak boleh kawal.

34
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,820
Itu manusia.

35
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:28,330
Maka bila benda luar kawalan kita,

36
00:01:28,330 --> 00:01:30,960
memang di luar kemampuan kita dah,

37
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:32,960
maka kita nak bergantung kat siapa?

38
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,960
Gantung pada Allah.
